# 3. Bank Account Data

The application stores the following information:

| Field           | Example | Description                |
| --------------- | ------- | -------------------------- |
| `id`            | `1`     | Automatically generated ID |
| `customerName`  | `John`  | Customer name              |
| `accountNumber` | `6382`  | Bank account number        |
| `balance`       | `425`   | Account balance            |

Example JSON:

```json
{
    "customerName": "John",
    "accountNumber": "6382",
    "balance": 425
}
```

The `id` does not need to be provided when creating an account because MySQL generates it automatically.

