# 4. REST API Endpoints

## Create Account

```text
POST http://localhost:8099/api/accounts
```

Example body:

```json
{
    "customerName": "John",
    "accountNumber": "6382",
    "balance": 425
}
```

---

## Get All Accounts

```text
GET http://localhost:8099/api/accounts
```

---

## Get One Account

```text
GET http://localhost:8099/api/accounts/1
```

---

## Update Account

```text
PUT http://localhost:8099/api/accounts/1
```

Example body:

```json
{
    "customerName": "John",
    "accountNumber": "6382",
    "balance": 750
}
```

---

## Delete Account

```text
DELETE http://localhost:8099/api/accounts/1
```

