# 16. Simple Workflow

```text
1. Write Java code
       ↓
2. mvn clean package -DskipTests
       ↓
3. Docker builds Spring Boot image
       ↓
4. docker compose up --build
       ↓
5. MySQL container starts
       ↓
6. Spring Boot container starts
       ↓
7. Open http://localhost:8099/
       ↓
8. Add / View / Update / Delete accounts
       ↓
9. Data is stored in MySQL
```

## Project Purpose

This project is intended as a **simple demonstration of Spring Boot CRUD, REST API, MySQL, Docker, Docker Compose, and a static web UI**. It is not intended to represent a production banking system.


